    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "It would be useful to have a new text object that is similar to the existing text objects, but a new version that is restricted or bounded by newlines at the same indentation level:\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n```\r\n    def sample_function():\r\n        print(\"hello world\")\r\n\r\n        print(\"some text\")\r\n        print(\"more *text\")      <--- cursor here\r\n        print(\"even more text\")\r\n\r\n        print(\"some more text\")\r\n```\r\nThis would select:\r\n```\r\n        print(\"some text\")\r\n        print(\"more text\")\r\n        print(\"even more text\")\r\n```",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">It would be useful to have a new text object that is similar to the existing text objects, but a new version that is restricted or bounded by newlines at the same indentation level:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Example:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"    def sample_function():\n        print(&quot;hello world&quot;)\n\n        print(&quot;some text&quot;)\n        print(&quot;more *text&quot;)      &lt;--- cursor here\n        print(&quot;even more text&quot;)\n\n        print(&quot;some more text&quot;)\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">    def sample_function():\n        print(\"hello world\")\n\n        print(\"some text\")\n        print(\"more *text\")      &lt;--- cursor here\n        print(\"even more text\")\n\n        print(\"some more text\")\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This would select:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"        print(&quot;some text&quot;)\n        print(&quot;more text&quot;)\n        print(&quot;even more text&quot;)\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">        print(\"some text\")\n        print(\"more text\")\n        print(\"even more text\")\n</code></pre></div>",
    "bodyText": "It would be useful to have a new text object that is similar to the existing text objects, but a new version that is restricted or bounded by newlines at the same indentation level:\nExample:\n    def sample_function():\n        print(\"hello world\")\n\n        print(\"some text\")\n        print(\"more *text\")      <--- cursor here\n        print(\"even more text\")\n\n        print(\"some more text\")\n\nThis would select:\n        print(\"some text\")\n        print(\"more text\")\n        print(\"even more text\")",
