                    "body": "Ok. Maybe I'll try to create my own new textobject.\r\n\r\nHere's why `ap` and `ip` don't work:\r\n\r\n```\r\n    def sample_function()\r\n        print(\"hello world\")\r\n\r\n        print(\"some text\")\r\n        print(\"more text\")\r\n        print(\"even more text\")\r\n\r\n        print(\"some more *text\")      <--- cursor here\r\n    def another_function()\r\n        print \"random text\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n`ip`/`ap` will select this:\r\n```\r\n        print(\"some more text\")\r\n    def another_function()\r\n        print \"random text\"\r\n````",
