                    "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Here's why <code class=\"notranslate\">ap</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">ip</code> don't work:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"    def sample_function()\n        print(&quot;hello world&quot;)\n\n        print(&quot;some text&quot;)\n        print(&quot;more text&quot;)\n        print(&quot;even more text&quot;)\n\n        print(&quot;some more *text&quot;)      &lt;--- cursor here\n    def another_function()\n        print &quot;random text&quot;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">    def sample_function()\n        print(\"hello world\")\n\n        print(\"some text\")\n        print(\"more text\")\n        print(\"even more text\")\n\n        print(\"some more *text\")      &lt;--- cursor here\n    def another_function()\n        print \"random text\"\n</code></pre></div>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I would do <code class=\"notranslate\">V{j</code> in this case. And <code class=\"notranslate\">V}k</code> in mirrored one. <code class=\"notranslate\">ii</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">ip</code> should cover other cases.</p>",
